\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns the current location of the dragged image\'27s origin in the base coordinate system of the destination object\'27s window. The image moves along with the mouse pointer (the position of which is given by \b draggingLocation\b0 ) but may be positioned at some offset.\
