\f0 \b \fs28 \pard \s40 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx8265 {{\NeXTHelpMarker8412 \markername NS_DEV_DOCFOR:objc_method:[NSDraggingInfo-draggingSourceOperationMask];}
¬}\pard \s40 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx8265 draggingSourceOperationMask\
\fs6\
\pard \s39 \li2520 \fi-604 \ri1007 \ql \f1 \b0 \fs28 \f3 -\f1  (unsigned int)\b draggingSourceOperationMask\b0  \
\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns the dragging operation mask declared by the dragging source (through its \b draggingSourceOperationMaskForLocal:\b0  method). If the source permits dragging operations, the elements in the mask will be one or more of the following, combined using the C bitwise OR operator:\
\fs14\
\pard \s62 \li1915 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx6753 \tx9553 \f0 \b \fs28 Option\tab Meaning\
\fs6\
\pard \s60 \li6753 \fi-4838 \ri1007 \ql \tx6753 \tx9525 \f1 \b0 \fs28 NSDragOperationCopy\tab The data represented by the image can be copied.\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSDragOperationLink\tab The data can be shared.\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSDragOperationGeneric\tab The operation can be defined by the destination.\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSDragOperationPrivate\tab The operation is negotiated privately between the source and the destination.\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSDragOperationAll\tab Combines all the above.\
\fs14\
\pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 \fs28 If the source does not permit any dragging operations, then method should return NSDragOperationNone.\
\fs14\
\fs28 If the user is holding down a modifier key during the dragging session and the source doesn\'27t prohibit modifier keys from affecting the drag operation (through its \b ignoreModifierKeysWhileDragging\b0  method), then the operating system combines the dragging operation value that corresponds to the modifier key (see the descriptions below) with the source\'27s mask using the C bitwise AND operator. \
\fs14\
\fs28 On Mach the modifier keys are associated with the dragging operation options shown below,\
\fs14\
\pard \s62 \li1915 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx6753 \tx9553 \f0 \b \fs28 Modifier Key\tab Dragging Option\
\fs6\
\pard \s60 \li6753 \fi-4838 \ri1007 \ql \tx6753 \tx9525 \f1 \b0 \fs28 Control\tab NSDragOperationLink\
\fs14\
\fs28 Alternate\tab NSDragOperationCopy\
\fs14\
\fs28 Command\tab NSDragOperationGeneric\
\fs14\
\pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 \fs28 while on Windows the modifier keys are associated with the following dragging operation options.\
\fs14\
\pard \s62 \li1915 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx6753 \tx9553 \f0 \b \fs28 Modifier Key\tab Dragging Option\
\fs6\
\pard \s60 \li6753 \fi-4838 \ri1007 \ql \tx6753 \tx9525 \f1 \b0 \fs28 Control\tab NSDragOperationCopy\
\fs14\
\fs28 Shift-Control\tab NSDragOperationLink\
\fs14\
\fs28 Alternate\tab NSDragOperationCopy\
